   "t": "Я согласен на этот спор!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Посмотрим, какой из тебя повар!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "So the stakes are set: one dish, one taster, and Max's job on the line. Remember \"let's bet\" and \"I agree\", the two phrases that start the whole wager.",
   "gap": 0.5
